        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: House Shoes, Danny Brown, Phat Kat, Proof, Elzhi, Pumpkinhead, Marv Won, J Dilla, Quelle Chris, Alchemist, Black Milk, Denmark Vessey, Fuzz Scoota, Guilty Simpson, Jimetta Rose, Mosel\n- Products: Ghost at the Finish Line\n- Places: Detroit, Michigan\n- Roles: producer, rapper\n\nFacts:\n- Danny Brown, born Daniel Dewan Sewell on March 16, 1981, is an American rapper from Detroit, Michigan.\n- House Shoes served as a producer on albums by Phat Kat, Proof, Elzhi, Pumpkinhead, Marv Won, J Dilla, Danny Brown, and Quelle Chris, among others.\n- Ghost at the Finish Line is a thirteen-track record that featured guest appearances by Alchemist, Black Milk, Denmark Vessey, Fuzz Scoota, Guilty Simpson, House Shoes, Jimetta Rose, Marv Won, and Mosel.",
